                                                "sense_id": "f052ef6c-52e8-3730-9943-9becfe7a6aaa",
                                                "text": "[…] a \"creeled foot \" strapped to relieve strained muscles, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d87dcbe1-cfe7-40d0-a71f-4d63a9937b5a",
                                                "sense_id": "f052ef6c-52e8-3730-9943-9becfe7a6aaa",
                                                "text": "He creeled his ankle when he jumped off the porch. […] Vinegar was a key ingredient in many remedies for a creeled ankle."
                                            }
